# Per-run eval outputs: ignore by default, but COMMIT (a) the reference tables/matrices at the top
# level and (b) the resume state (predictions.jsonl / summary.json at any depth), so a GPU-limited
# run can be checkpointed to git and resumed after the container resets (scripts/run_checkpointed.sh).
